HANDOFF:
Bar 65 ends on F#7 at T=56: solo cello on F#3, violas A#3-C#4, basses F#1,
ppp.  Moonlight (b66, T=64) begins with one bar of the nocturne figure and the
heartbeat (as b13), then violins I take the tune (b67).
